@host = http://localhost:5176
@user = local

### Health + active AI provider
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Certifications with domain weights and bank counts
GET {{host}}/api/certifications

### Generate questions (falls back to the template bank when Ai:Provider is Offline)
POST {{host}}/api/questions/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "certificationCode": "AIF-C01",
  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "count": 5,
  "topicHint": "Amazon Bedrock guardrails and inference parameters"
}

### Browse the question bank
GET {{host}}/api/questions?certificationCode=AIF-C01&take=10

### Start a 10-question practice set
POST {{host}}/api/exams
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Key: {{user}}

{
  "certificationCode": "AIF-C01",
  "mode": "Practice",
  "questionCount": 10
}

### Answer a question (replace both ids with values from the session above)
POST {{host}}/api/exams/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/answers
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Key: {{user}}

{
  "questionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "selectedLabels": ["A"],
  "secondsSpent": 42
}

### Score the session (idempotent)
POST {{host}}/api/exams/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/submit
X-User-Key: {{user}}

### Completed sessions
GET {{host}}/api/exams/history?certificationCode=AIF-C01
X-User-Key: {{user}}

### ML.NET readiness projection
GET {{host}}/api/insights/AIF-C01/readiness
X-User-Key: {{user}}
